	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"（5/8記載）諸般の都合により、商品の発売月を変更させていただきました。",
			"ガンダムシリーズ最新作『機動戦士ガンダム 水星の魔女』より、ガンダム・シュバルゼッテがHGで立体化！",
			"• 多彩な形態を再現可能な多目的攻防プラットフォームガーディアンが付属。機体背部に装着が可能。",
			"• ガーディアン内部のシェルユニットはプラスチックシールで再現。",
			"• 首・腰部のボールジョイントは空間を設けた構造で前後傾の姿勢にも対応。",
			"• 開き手(左)が付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"(Posted on 5/8) Due to various circumstances, we have changed the product release.",
			"From the latest Gundam series \"Mobile Suit Gundam Witch of Mercury\", Gundam Schwarzette is now three-dimensional in HG!",
			"• Comes with a multi-purpose offensive and defensive platform guardian that can reproduce a variety of forms. Can be attached to the back of the aircraft.",
			"• The shell unit inside the Guardian is reproduced with plastic Seal.",
			"• The ball joints in the neck and lower back have a spaced structure that allows for forward and backward leaning postures.",
			"• Opening hand (left) is included."
		]
	},
